Prompt A
Create an artwork using colored pencils and graphite that emphasizes line, shape, texture, contrast, and movement. The artwork will show a peaceful sunset over a small coastal town, with a lighthouse standing on tall rocky cliffs. Waves will crash against the rocks while seagulls fly across the colorful sky, and a small sailboat will travel toward the horizon. I will use colored pencils, graphite pencils, and an eraser to create details and shading. I will use layering, blending, and cross-hatching to create texture in the rocks, waves, clouds, and lighthouse. I will also use warm orange, pink, and yellow colors to contrast with the cool blues of the ocean. These techniques will give the artwork depth, balance, and a realistic appearance.
Prompt B
Create an artwork using linocut printmaking that shows a peaceful sunset over a small coastal town, with a lighthouse standing on tall rocky cliffs. Waves will crash against the rocks while seagulls fly across the colorful sky, and a small sailboat travels toward the horizon. I will use linoleum blocks, carving tools, printing ink, a roller, and paper to create the artwork. I will focus on line, shape, texture, contrast, and movement. I will use carving, inking, and layering to create bold lines and detailed textures in the lighthouse, rocks, waves, and clouds. The warm orange, pink, and yellow sunset will contrast with the cool blue ocean. The final print will have strong shapes, dark outlines, and a beautiful sunset atmosphere.
